m1-metal2vulkan: the Metal API on Vulkan for SiliconForest

Third-party software this directory's recipe fetches at a pinned revision (pin.env). None of it is
copied into this repository.

  metal2vulkan (translator, AIR front end, runtime, harness, conformance suite)
    https://github.com/steelbrain/metal2vulkan  (Anees Iqbal and contributors)
    SPDX: GPL-2.0-or-later OR LGPL-3.0-or-later. SiliconForest takes it under
    LGPL-3.0-or-later. Our one change, patches/0001-conformance-replay-only-without-native-metal.patch,
    is a modification of metal2vulkan files and is under the same licence.
    The staged binaries carry the licence texts in share/.
    Fixtures and conformance recordings are staged on the M1 for testing, never committed here.

  Build-host tools (not shipped): Rust (MIT OR Apache-2.0), zig's libSystem.tbd stub (MIT),
  LLVM llvm-as and ld64.lld (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception).

Our own files here (README, pin.env, tools/, smoke/) are MIT.

Excluded by the owner (22 November 2026): nothing from Darling (darlinghq: darling, darling-metal,
Indium, Iridium, mslc) or PureDarwin's Metal code is used, linked, vendored or called by this
directory. metal2vulkan contains no Darling code (checked: no reference in its tree at the pin).
